<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;BR&gt;Is Shade in trouble?</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;BR&gt;Kaia's Faerie is on its way to Oblivion Woods.</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;PCNAME&gt;! This way.</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;PCNAME&gt;, you are now my sword. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;I know you will do well.</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;img src='img://__Image_Dungeon_3024.3204'/&gt;This teleportal leads to the &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Catalepticon&lt;/font&gt;.</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;img src='img://__Image_Dungeon_3107.3107'/&gt;This teleportal takes you to the &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Desolarus Testing Grounds&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;img src='img://__Image_Dungeon_3205.3205'/&gt;(This teleportal takes you to the &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Fusion Laboratory&lt;/font&gt;.)</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;img src='img://__Image_Dungeon_9068.9068'/&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;(This teleportal takes you out of the dungeon to the &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Shadow Sanguinary Entrance&lt;/font&gt; in Val Oryin.)</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;img src='img://__Image_Dungeon_9830.9830'/&gt;&lt;BR&gt;You must overcome challenging trials on each level in the Celestial Arena!&lt;BR&gt;If you'd like, I can send you there right now.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Entering the Celestial Arena costs 70 Adventure Coins.&lt;/font&gt;</Page>
<Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">(Kaia's Faerie looks at you with interest.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Follow the Faerie.)</Page>
