<Page social="4">These pillars were constructed by the first Baraka who settled Balderon. Seeing such ancient history damaged like this is disappointing to say the least</Page>
<Page social="4">They speak of your courage and prowess, and in this dire hour, we need a champion.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Your strength and courage could turn the tide of this battle and save Arborea.</Page>
<Page social="4">This isn't home, but at least we're staying put for awhile.</Page>
<Page social="4">We will soon engage the Infernal Covenant on all three fronts, pushing them back and reclaiming our line on the Spring of Arun that we once held. Now that their Commander Ruqii is dead, their army is extremely weak.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;We need to make sure our soldiers don’t get overzealous. We need to reclaim our defensive position and hold the line. We have been instructed to not go on the offensive yet.</Page>
<Page social="4">We will soon engage the Infernal Covenant on all three fronts, pushing them back and reclaiming our line on the Spring of Arun that we once held. Now that their Commander Ruqii is dead, their army is extremely weak.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;We need to make sure our soldiers don’t get overzealous. We need to reclaim our defensive position and hold the line. We have been instructed to not go on the offensive yet.</Page>
<Page social="4">Welcome to Balderon.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;We separated ourselves willingly to ensure peace while we studied all of Southern Arun.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Please don't bring cause senseless battle on our soil.</Page>
<Page social="4">Well met, &lt;PCNAME&gt;.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;What am I doing in Balderon? I told you that I would do whatever it takes to locate Dakuryon and enact my revenge for what he did to my people. I have been tracking him this entire time and he was most recently here. No doubt, he’s planning something that involves Baldera and its people.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Be ready, &lt;PCNAME&gt;.</Page>
<Page social="4">We’ll be leaving soon to patrol the Spring of Arun and keep the Giant Bees and Giant Murderous Plants at bay.</Page>
<Page social="4">We’re going to conquer the Renegade Garden soon. We need to show the Infernal Covenant who runs Baldera sooner than later.</Page>
<Page social="4">What I am certain of is that you will not disappoint the residents of Arborea. We will navigate through this challenge as a united front.</Page>
<Page social="4">When the Elders first told us that it was safe to see Balderon again, I wasn’t sure if I could believe them. However, I don’t think I could have stayed in those cramped Archives any longer!</Page>
<Page social="4">Where's that sacred fountain! Why can't I find it?&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Urgh... Who are you?</Page>
<Page social="4">Word has spread to the Mysterium that there were Argons in Baldera. As soon as we heard the news, many of us were sent to Baldera. It seems I was the first to arrive. The Argons here are much stronger than the ones in Arborea...</Page>
<Page social="4">Yes, yes, we're helping—whoo and stuff. Go us.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;No really, it makes me all fuzzy inside.&lt;BR&gt;Why don't you join us? The Valkyon Federation is old news by now.</Page>
<Page social="4">You see that pillar right there? It used to be up on the hill. We’re lucky it didn’t cause damage to the foundation or we’d have to repair the entire wall below us.</Page>
<Page social="4">You've done well &lt;PCNAME&gt;.However, I must express my concern regarding the impending threat posed by the dragons amassing their strength.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Stand strong, guardian, we will require your strength in the days to come.</Page>
<Page social="4">Your ambition to master the balance of grace and power is commendable. We will nurture that in you.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Remember, becoming the best &lt;PCCLASS:lcase&gt; Balderon has ever seen will require dedication, perseverance, and a willingness to grow in every aspect.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;I have no doubt that you possess the potential to achieve greatness.</Page>
<Page social="4">Zzoragath &lt;PCNAME&gt;.Ah, my apologies...&lt;BR&gt;Hello &lt;PCNAME&gt;! Greetings in your tongue.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;I've journeyed far to present you with extraordinary items in exchange for your hard-earned &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Blitz Barrage coins&lt;/font&gt; you've earned in the &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Blitz Barrage battleground&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Your hard-fought Blitz Barrage coins hold value in my galaxy.</Page>
<Page social="4">Zzoragath,&lt;PCNAME&gt;!&lt;BR&gt;I am Astro, Snazzle's companion. Together, we navigate the celestial currents to bring you treasures from the cosmos.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="120">Greetings &lt;PCNAME&gt;. This place is really busy.. I heard there were lots of battles but it's even worse than I imagined.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;It's an honor to see you in person. I've heard you've been through a lot.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="132">This area is not safe. There are those who would prey on the weak and exploit the vulnerable.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;But fear not, for I am here to keep them at bay.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="136">You can use your enemy's strength against them to forge new equipment.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="48">&lt;PCNAME&gt; I have heard of your conquest through this territory we once thought lost to time. Now that I've had time to stabilize the Core and return Allemantheia to peace, I am free to come check on progress the Federation has made. I understand the Black Core from Exodor opened the seal on Baldera, and we found the Spring of Arun? Fascinating...&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;I shall assist Seir and Tamur however I can. I've been gone far too long because of the Core. It's time I did my part to assist the Federation once again.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="48">It has been rough for everyone, but admittedly Allemantheia has it better than most. Our biggest concern is the amber powder crystallization, but many would prefer that to Argonification...&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;A new Gossamer Regent has come out of their chrysalis recently. It might be worth checking out, since this one was affected by the Veil while growing.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="67">You look like you need to rest a bit. I can restore your power so you can continue fighting.</Page>
<Page social="5" voiceTypeId="67">You look weary. My magic can restore your vigor, and allow you to return to the fight.</Page>
<Page social="5">Ugh! Those pesky vermin are littering the beaches again... Don't they get bored of having the same drinks, meals, and games to play each year?! Maybe next year I'll get the Vampirs to do something special!&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;...And don't even get me started on those praying to their false Gods!&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;You... Yes you, &lt;PCCLASS:lcase&gt;! You reek of death. Almost like you have Bloody Dawn Coins from the Banquet of— Ah, what am I saying! There's no way an outsider like you would be allowed to participate in the superior festivities!</Page>
<Page social="50" voiceTypeId="0">So much power. Far stronger than I expected...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Possibly even enough to open a path to my true master.</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="0">Kaiator may not be a very fertile place, but the city is an impregnable fortress.</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="0">This is where I first met you, &lt;PCNAME&gt;.</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="114">Researchers like me can’t get lazy with their studies. The sun shines when it shines. You just have to see it.</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="127">&lt;PCNAME&gt;, I'm glad you're here.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;The archdevans created an armored fangspawn to harass us while they headed south for a secret mission in Velika. Their mission failed...but the fangspawn is still here, and it's getting hungry.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;The beast must be eliminated before it can claw its way out of the holding pen where we've trapped it.&lt;BR&gt;Unfortunately, we can only send one person in at a time, which means you'll have to tackle the beast alone.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Entering the Pit of Petrax costs 80 Adventure Coins.&lt;/font&gt;</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="26">I might not have much gold with me, but I keep track of the Server Treasury for you!</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="64">Cooking,Fishing.. all you need, I have it! What are you looking for?</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="64">You can trade Angler tokens with me! Are you a newbie fisherman?</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="69">All the tasty food here! I will never get enough of it.</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="80">Cooking, Fishing... all you need, I have it! What are you looking for?</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="87">I'm in need of some fish crates for my upcoming shipment. Do you happen to have any available?</Page>
<Page social="6" voiceTypeId="91">What have you got for me today? Ah, lovely fresh fish, just what I'm after. Let me take a look at what you've got.</Page>
<Page social="6">Our interstellar journey has brought us to your world, offering great exchanges for your Blitz Barrage coins.</Page>
<Page social="6">Whether you're a citizen or tourist, I hope you enjoy your stay and experience the vibrant culture and rich history of Baldera.</Page>
<Page social="7" voiceTypeId="119">Big day today, &lt;PCNAME&gt;!&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Can you imagine? Taking a nap and seeing with the eyes of the gods?</Page>
<Page social="7" voiceTypeId="129">Too busy. Can't talk.</Page>
<Page social="7" voiceTypeId="130">Sometimes I like to think about the old days....</Page>
<Page social="7" voiceTypeId="130">Sometimes I like to think about the old days....</Page>
<Page social="7" voiceTypeId="130">This place is peaceful.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Well, compared to the battlefields I've been through. The battlefield is the place where people show their true colors.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;I will stick around here for a while. Cause I'm tired of the battlefield.</Page>
<Page social="7">Hello &lt;PCNAME&gt;!&lt;BR&gt;I've heard tales of this place, but experiencing it firsthand is a whole new level of awe.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;This teleportal here can bring you back to the &lt;font color='#0000FF'&gt;Exodor Archipelago&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;If you need a guide, I'll gladly be by your side.</Page>
